# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
ocrenv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Machine-specific tool state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contains absolute paths under C:\Users\<name>\... and per-session scratch
# directories. Project-wide settings, if any are ever added, belong in
# .claude/settings.json, which is NOT ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party source material -- NOT ours to redistribute
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scanned copies of published, in-copyright books (~51 MB), and Astrodienst's
# published ephemeris tables (~6 MB). They are inputs to the pipeline, not
# products of it. Keeping them out avoids redistributing other people's work
# and keeps clones small. The derived corpus in Knowledge/ IS committed.
#
# To include them anyway, delete the four lines below.
Books/*.pdf
Ephemeris/*.pdf
!Books/README.md
!Ephemeris/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendored binaries -- fetched, not committed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Swiss Ephemeris is dual-licensed (AGPL or commercial); redistributing the
# compiled library carries obligations this repo should not take on silently.
# Restore with:  python Engine/vendor/fetch_swisseph.py
Engine/vendor/swisseph/*.dll
Engine/vendor/swisseph/*.so
Engine/vendor/swisseph/*.dylib
Engine/vendor/swisseph/*.se1
Engine/vendor/swisseph/LICENSE

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Case files hold real people's birth details -- date, exact time and place of
# birth. That is personal data and does not belong in version control.
# Regenerate the demo consultation with:
#   python -m Engine.cli --date 1987-03-14 --time 04:22 --tz Asia/Kolkata \
#       --lat 10.7870 --lon 79.1378 --place "Thanjavur" --out Cases/demo/consultation.md
Cases/

# Rendered page images: ~239 MB of PNGs, reproducible in about a minute with
#   python Pipeline/tools/render_pages.py <book-id> <pdf>
Pipeline/books/*/img/

# The OCR cache under Pipeline/books/*/ocr/ IS committed on purpose: it needs a
# GPU and the Surya environment to regenerate, the build validates page
# fingerprints against it, and it is only ~4 MB.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
scratch/
tmp/
